Compile if __STDC_VERSION__ is at least 202311:
    Say "c23".
Elif __STDC_VERSION__ is at least 201112:
    Say "c11".
Otherwise:
    Say "older".
End compile if.
Compile if LEVEL is equal to 3:
    Say "level three".
Elif LEVEL is greater than 3:
    Say "above three".
Otherwise:
    Say "below three".
End compile if.
Compile if MISSING is not defined:
    Say "missing".
End compile if.
Compile if LEVEL is less than 10:
    Say "small".
End compile if.
